    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d513-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0963" n="839" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg839"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Las Vegas, N. Mex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi>
                        7</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A dispatch to the Gazette says Nane, with 50 renegade Apaches, crossed the line
                    of the Atchison, Topeka and Santa Fé Railroad, near Eagle Station, on Friday, in
                    the direction of Argha Mountains, near where Lieutenant Guilfoyle had his first
                    brush with the band.</p>
            </div>
